@startuml JupiterQuoteFlow
title Current Jupiter quote-only flow

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Courier
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Jupiter module" as Jupiter
participant "Jupiter Lite API" as API

Runtime -> Jupiter : run() (currently disabled in main)
Jupiter -> Jupiter : Build SOL -> USDC quote URL\namount = 1 SOL in lamports
Jupiter -> API : GET /swap/v1/quote
API --> Jupiter : Quote JSON or HTTP error

alt successful JSON
  Jupiter -> Jupiter : Deserialize SwapOrder
  Jupiter -> Runtime : Print formatted quote
else request or parsing failure
  Jupiter -> Runtime : Print diagnostic error
end

note over Jupiter, API
Transaction building, signing, simulation,
and swap execution are not implemented.
end note

@enduml
